<p id="Sx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This work was partially funded by the ERC (853489 - DEXIM), the Alfried Krupp von Bohlen und Halbach Foundation and Berkeley AI Research (BAIR) Commons, which we thank for their generous support. The authors gratefully acknowledge the scientific support and resources of the AI service infrastructure <span id="Sx3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">LRZ AI Systems</span> provided by the Leibniz Supercomputing Centre (LRZ) of the Bavarian Academy of Sciences and Humanities (BAdW), funded by Bayerisches Staatsministerium für Wissenschaft und Kunst (StMWK).</p>
</div>
